<title>JAPAN: Daido Life Ins 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Daido Life Ins 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	  (in billions yen unless specified)</p>
